<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>BIHARI KISAN — Bihar's Farmer Marketplace</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+Devanagari:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/dashboardCss/dash.css">
<script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest/dist/umd/lucide.js"></script>
<link
  href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/fonts/remixicon.css"
  rel="stylesheet"
/>
</head>
<body>
  
<header class="topbar">
  <a class="brand" >
    <span class="leaf">🌾</span>
    <span>BIHARI KISAN
      <span class="brand-sub" ">
        .in
      </span>
    </span>
  </a>

  <a class="location">
    <i data-lucide="map-pin"></i>
    <span>
      <span class="l1">Delivering to Asansol 713325</span>
      <span class="l2">Update location</span>
    </span>
  </a>

  <div class="search-bar">
    <select class="search-select">
      <option>All</option>
      <option>Vegetables</option>
      <option>Fruits</option>
      <option>Grains</option>
    </select>
    <input type="text" placeholder="Search crops, tools, sellers...">
    <button aria-label="Search"><i class="ri-search-line"></i></button>
  </div>

   <div class="top-right">
    <a class="top-right-item">
      <i class="ri-global-line mobile-icon"></i>
      <span>
        <span class="small">EN</span>
        <span class="big">🇮🇳 हिन्दी</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <a class="top-right-item" href="/dash/register">
      <i class="ri-user-line mobile-icon"></i>
      <span>
        <span class="small">Hello, sign in</span>
        <span class="big">Account & Lists</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <a class="top-right-item">
      <i class="ri-truck-line mobile-icon"></i>
      <span>
        <span class="small">Track</span>
        <span class="big">Orders</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <a class="top-right-item cart-badge">
      <i class="ri-shopping-bag-4-fill"></i>
      <span class="count">0</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="catnav">
  <a class="menu-all" ></a>
  <a >Vegetables</a>
   <a class="highlight">Sell on Bihari Kisan</a>
  <a >Fruits</a>
  <a >Grains &amp; Pulses</a>
  <a >Farm Tools</a>
  <a >Market Prices</a>
  <a >Weather</a>
  <a >Government Schemes</a>
  <a >Transport (Soon)</a>
  <a>Help</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <button class="hero-nav-btn left" aria-label="Previous">
    <i class="ri-arrow-left-double-fill"></i>
  </button>
  <div class="hero-text">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Sell your harvest</div>
    <div class="hero-headline">Zero commission<br>this week</div>
    <div class="hero-links">
      <span>Top mandis</span>
      <span>Trusted buyers</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span class="logo-mini">BK<br>PAY</span>
      <span><b>Direct bank payment</b>within 24 hours of sale</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-img">
    <img src="/photos/headerImg.avif" 
    alt="Farmer harvesting crops in a green field">
  </div>
  <button class="hero-nav-btn right" aria-label="Next">
    <i class="ri-arrow-right-double-fill"></i>
  </button>
</section>

<section class="grid-wrap">
  <div class="cat-card">
    <h3>Fresh from the farm | Vegetables, grains &amp; pulses</h3>
    <div class="cat-sub">
      <a class="cat-item" >
        <img src="/photos/tomato.avif" alt="Tomatoes">
        <span>Tomato</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cat-item" >
        <img src="/photos/potato.avif" alt="Potatoes">
        <span>Potato</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cat-item" >
        <img src="/photos/onion.avif" alt="Onions">
        <span>Onion</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cat-item" >
        <img src="/photos/rice.avif" alt="Rice">
        <span>Rice</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cat-item" >
        <img src="/photos/wheat.avif" alt="Wheat">
        <span>Wheat</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cat-item" >
        <img src="/photos/Mustard seeds.avif" alt="Mustard seeds">
        <span>Mustard</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <a class="link" href="/dash/register">Shop fresh produce</a>
    </div>

  <div class="cat-card">
    <h3>Farm essentials | Tools &amp; farmer support</h3>
    <div class="cat-sub">
      <a class="cat-item">
        <img src="/photos/handTool.avif" alt="Hand tools">
        <span>Hand tools</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cat-item" >
        <img src="/photos/seeds.avif" alt="Seeds">
        <span>Seeds</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cat-item">
        <img src="/photos/fertiliser.avif" alt="Fertiliser">
        <span>Fertiliser</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cat-item">
        <img src="/photos/gov schem.avif" alt="Government scheme documents">
        <span>Schemes</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cat-item">
        <img src="/photos/weather.avif" alt="Weather forecast sky">
        <span>Weather</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cat-item">
        <img src="/photos/support.avif" alt="Support helpline">
        <span>Helpline</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <a class="link" href="/dash/register" >Explore farm essentials</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="trust-strip">
  <div class="trust-item">
    <div class="trust-icon"><i class="ri-verified-badge-fill"></i></div>
    <h4>Verified buyers only</h4>
    <p>Every buyer is ID-checked before listing access</p>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-item">
    <div class="trust-item"></div>
    <div class="trust-icon"><i class="ri-paypal-line"></i></div>
    <h4>Direct payment, no middleman</h4>
    <p>Money goes straight to your bank or UPI</p>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-item">
    <div class="trust-icon"><i class="ri-translate-2"></i></div>
    <h4>Use in Hindi or English</h4>
    <p>Built for first-time smartphone users</p>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-item">
    <div class="trust-icon"><i class="ri-customer-service-2-line"></i></div>
    <h4>Help in your language</h4>
    <p>Call or WhatsApp our support team anytime</p>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section-block">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Today's mandi prices</h2>
    <a class="link">See all prices</a>
  </div>
  <div class="price-row">
    <div class="price-card">
      <div class="emoji">🍅</div>
      <div class="name">Tomato</div>
      <div class="price">₹1,850</div>
      <div class="chg up">▲ 8.2%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="price-card">
      <div class="emoji">🥔</div>
      <div class="name">Potato</div>
      <div class="price">₹1,120</div>
      <div class="chg down">▼ 5.1%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="price-card">
      <div class="emoji">🌾</div>
      <div class="name">Rice</div>
      <div class="price">₹2,340</div>
      <div class="chg up">▲ 1.7%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="price-card">
      <div class="emoji">🌿</div>
      <div class="name">Wheat</div>
      <div class="price">₹2,180</div>
      <div class="chg up">▲ 1.4%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="price-card">
      <div class="emoji">🧅</div>
      <div class="name">Onion</div>
      <div class="price">₹980</div>
      <div class="chg down">▼ 6.6%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="price-card">
      <div class="emoji">🌼</div>
      <div class="name">Mustard</div>
      <div class="price">₹5,420</div>
      <div class="chg up">▲ 3.0%</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="seller-cta">
  <div class="seller-cta-text">
    <h2>Naye ho? Apna pehla product 2 minute mein bechein.</h2>
    <p>Create a free account, upload a photo of your crop, and get offers from verified buyers near you — no paperwork, no fees to join.</p>
    <div class="seller-cta-actions">
      <a class="btn-white" href="/dash/register">Create free account</a>
      <a class="btn-ghost" href="/dash/register">See how it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="seller-cta-img">
    <img src="/photos/farmer prooft..avif" alt="Farmer using a smartphone in a field">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="app-strip">
  <div class="app-strip-text">
    <h3>Get the Bihari Kisan app</h3>
    <p>Check prices, weather and orders on the go — works even on low network.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="app-store-badges">
    <a class="store-badge"><i class="ri-smartphone-line"></i> Download for Android</a>
    <a class="store-badge"><i class="ri-apple-line"></i> Download for iOS</a>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="back-to-top" onclick="window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})">Back to top</div>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-grid">
    <div>
      <h4>Get to know us</h4>
      <a href="#">About Bihari Kisan</a>
      <a href="#">How it works</a>
      <a href="#">Careers</a>
      <a href="#">Press</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4>For farmers</h4>
      <a href="#">Sell on Bihari Kisan</a>
      <a href="#">Market prices</a>
      <a href="#">Government schemes</a>
      <a href="#">Weather forecast</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4>For buyers</h4>
      <a href="#">Browse crops</a>
      <a href="#">Verified sellers</a>
      <a href="#">Bulk orders</a>
      <a href="#">Track order</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4>Let us help you</h4>
      <a href="#">Help Center</a>
      <a href="#">WhatsApp support</a>
      <a href="#">Emergency helpline</a>
      <a href="#">FAQ</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <div class="footer-brand"><span>🌾</span> BIHARI KISAN</div>
    <p>© 2026 Bihari Kisan. Made for farmers, by Bihar.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<script src="/js/dashboardJs/dash.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
